            "value" : "Yongeza iqhosha lakho le-API ye-debrid kanye kwaye iNoiro iyisebenzisa kuyo yonke indawo, ngaphandle kwesiza esahlukileyo sokusetha. Iitorrents ezigciniweyo ziguqulwa zibe zizikhombisi ngqo ngokukhawuleza. Amaqhosha akho ahlala kwesi sixhobo kwaye athumelwa, agwetyiwe, kwiakhawunti yakho yeNoiro."
