        },
        "so" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toos wuxuu HDR iyo Dolby Vision u beddelaa SDR kaliya shaashad aan tusi karin HDR. Dooro Tone-map to SDR haddii remux-yada 4K Dolby Vision u muuqdaan kuwo daldaloolan, cagaar ama guduud; Always HDR si aad u qasabto in la sii marsiiyo."
