        },
        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tirohia ngā Apataki mō tētahi e whakarārangi ana i ngā \"Awa\" (kaua ko ngā Puranga, ko ngā Raraunga Meta rānei anake). Mēnā i kōkuku-whakamutua koe i te taupānga ināia tata nei, whakatuwherahia anō kia utaina anōtia ō apataki, tāpirihia anōtia rānei he apataki awa."
