        "zu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hlola Izengezo ukuze uthole esibhala \"Ama-Streams\" (hhayi nje ama-Catalog noma i-Metadata). Uma usanda kuphoqelela ukuvala i-app, yivule kabusha ukuze izengezo zakho zilayishwe kabusha, noma wengeze kabusha isengezo se-stream."
