        "sn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wana chiziviso kana chikamu chitsva chenhevedzano yawavhura choda kuratidzwa. Chinorongwa padhivhaisi kune zvikamu zviri kuuya, saka hapana kutevedzera kunodiwa kumashure."
