        "so" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hel ogeysiis marka qayb cusub oo taxane aad furto ay ku dhowdahay in la sii daayo. Waxaa lagu qorsheeyaa qalabka qaybaha soo socda, marka ma jiro dabagal gadaal ah oo loo baahdo."
