    "Noiro connects to your sources without hosting your media." : {

    },
    "Noiro discovers an HDHomeRun on your home network, saves its lineup and guide, and adds current programs to the Live TV tab. Enter the tuner IP if your router does not resolve hdhomerun.local. Guide artwork and program information require HDHomeRun guide access; if the tuner does not publish DeviceAuth, enter the email linked to that guide account." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the HDHomeRun tuner.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Noiro does not include a Gemini key. Get a free one at aistudio.google.com (API key) and paste it here. The key is stored in the device Keychain." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Gemini API key.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Noiro needs to quit and reopen to display the app in the new language. Open it again from the Home Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noiro moet afsluit en heropen om die toepassing in die nuwe taal te wys. Maak dit weer vanaf die tuisskerm oop."
          }
        },
        "am" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "መተግበሪያውን በአዲሱ ቋንቋ ለማሳየት Noiro መዘጋትና እንደገና መከፈት አለበት። ከመነሻ ማያ ገጹ ላይ እንደገና ይክፈቱት።"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحتاج Noiro إلى الإنهاء وإعادة الفتح لعرض التطبيق باللغة الجديدة. افتحه من جديد من الشاشة الرئيسية."
          }
        },
        "as" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "নতুন ভাষাত এপ্‌টো দেখুৱাবলৈ Noiro বন্ধ কৰি পুনৰ খোলিব লাগিব। Home Screen-ৰ পৰা ইয়াক পুনৰ খোলক।"
          }
        },
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tətbiqi yeni dildə göstərmək üçün Noiro bağlanıb yenidən açılmalıdır. Onu Ana ekrandan yenidən açın."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noiro павінен закрыцца і адкрыцца зноў, каб паказаць дадатак на новай мове. Адкрыйце яго зноў з галоўнага экрана."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noiro трябва да се затвори и отвори отново, за да покаже приложението на новия език. Отворете го отново от началния екран."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "নতুন ভাষায় অ্যাপটি দেখাতে Noiro বন্ধ করে আবার খুলতে হবে। হোম স্ক্রিন থেকে এটি আবার খুলুন।"
          }
        },
        "br" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ezhomm en deus Noiro da serriñ hag adigeriñ evit diskouez an arload er yezh nevez. Digorit anezhañ en-dro adalek ar Skramm Degemer."
          }
        },
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noiro se mora zatvoriti i ponovo otvoriti da prikaže aplikaciju na novom jeziku. Otvorite je ponovo sa početnog ekrana."
