        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I te Apple TV kei te haere mai he taruatanga matawai-ki-tō-waea: ka whakaatu te Taruatanga i tētahi waehere QR, ka matawaihia e koe ki tō waea, ā, ka tiaki ō tautuhinga ki tō pūkete Noiro. Ka whakaatu te Whakaora i tētahi atu waehere hei whakahoki tere i a rātou. Tae noa ki reira, mā te takiuru e whakaora tō whare pukapuka, ō apataki, me te hītori mātakitaki i konei."
          }
