        "zu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Okuzikhethelayo. Engeza okhiye bakho be-TMDB ne-MDBList ukuze uthuthukise izincomo nezilinganiso. Akukho okudingekayo lapha futhi okhiye bakho bahlala kule divayisi (futhi bavumelaniswe, befihliwe, ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Noiro)."
