        },
        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ka tukutahi ō kōtaha, tautuhinga, me ngā kī raraunga meta ki tēnei pūkete, kua whakamunatia mai-i-te-pito-ki-te-pito. Ka tukutahi aunoa hoki rātou i tētahi wā poto i muri i tētahi panoni."
