            "value" : "Iiprofayile zakho, iisetingi, kunye namaqhosha emetadata avunyelaniswa kule akhawunti, agwetywe kwasekuqaleni kuse ekupheleni. Kwakhona avunyelaniswa ngokuzenzekelayo emva komzuzwana wotshintsho."
